Package: phallogram
Title: Plot a Phallus-Shaped Histogram
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Christoffer", email = "christoffer1410@outlook.dk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A novelty package with a single function that generates data
    whose histogram is shaped like a phallus, and plots it.
